<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Fusion 시제품 제작 원데이 클래스 | (주)메타유닉스</title>
<meta name="description" content="비전공자도 하루 만에 아이디어를 실물로 제작합니다. Autodesk Fusion으로 설계부터 CNC 가공까지, 국비지원 90% 환급.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pretendard@1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#000000;
    --surface:rgba(255,255,255,.035);
    --surface-hover:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    --hairline:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    --hairline-soft:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    --text-hi:#f5f5f7;
    --text-lo:#86868b;
    --text-mute:#6e6e73;
    --accent:#ff5a1f;
    --accent-dim:#d94a17;
    --accent-soft:rgba(255,90,31,.14);
    --accent-line:rgba(255,90,31,.45);
    --radius:18px;
    --mono:'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace;
    --sans:'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ html{scroll-behavior:auto;} }
  body{
    margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-hi);font-family:var(--sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.5;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  ::selection{background:var(--accent);color:#000;}
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:3px;}

  .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  section.panel .wrap{text-align:center;}
  section.panel .table-wrap, section.panel .role-grid, section.panel .feature-list,
  section.panel .curriculum, section.panel .objection{text-align:left;}

  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-.005em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .section-title{font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,40px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 16px;}
  .section-lede{font-size:16px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.6;max-width:56ch;margin:0 auto 56px;}
  section.panel{padding:clamp(64px,11vw,140px) 0;}

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;
    border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;border:none;text-decoration:none;
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#0b0b0c;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:#ff6c39;transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(255,90,31,.28);}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--text-hi);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.38);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--text-hi);}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .btn-primary:hover{transform:none;} }

  .link-arrow{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:var(--text-hi);font-weight:500;font-size:16px;
    padding:14px 6px;text-decoration:none;
  }
  .link-arrow span{color:var(--accent);transition:transform .15s ease;}
  .link-arrow:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .link-arrow:hover span{transform:translateX(2px);}

  /* ---------------- HEADER ---------------- */
  .site-header{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:14px 24px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);
  }
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  .logo .mark{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--accent);}
  .badge{
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mute);margin-left:8px;display:none;
  }
  .badge::before{content:'·';margin-right:8px;color:var(--text-mute);}
  @media (min-width:560px){ .badge{display:inline-block;} }
  .site-header .btn{padding:9px 19px;font-size:13.5px;}

  /* ---------------- HERO ---------------- */
  .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:120px 0 80px;background-color:var(--bg);}
  .hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;overflow:hidden;background:#000;}
  .hero-bg iframe{
    position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;width:177.78vh;height:56.25vw;min-width:100%;min-height:100%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border:0;pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-bg-fallback{position:absolute;inset:0;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:.4;}
  .hero-overlay{
    position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.68) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.88) 55%, var(--bg) 100%);
  }
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;text-align:center;}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(32px,6.2vw,64px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.12;
    margin:0 auto 20px;max-width:17ch;
  }
  .hero h1 .hi{color:var(--accent);}
  .hero-sub{font-size:18px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.6;max-width:46ch;margin:0 auto 36px;}
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:36px;}
  .trust-row{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-mute);margin-bottom:52px;}
  .trust-row b{color:var(--text-lo);font-weight:500;}
  .fact-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;}
  .fact{flex:1 1 200px;padding:0 26px;border-right:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);text-align:center;}
  .fact:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .fact-label{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mute);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .fact-value{font-size:15.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-hi);}
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .fact-strip{flex-direction:column;gap:18px;}
    .fact{flex:1 1 100%;border-right:none;padding:0;}
  }

  /* ---------------- SCHEDULE TABLE ---------------- */
  .table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;min-width:520px;}
  th{
    text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;
    color:var(--text-mute);font-weight:500;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  td{padding:16px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);color:var(--text-lo);}
  tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  td.city{color:var(--text-hi);font-weight:600;}
  td.date{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-family:var(--mono);white-space:nowrap;}
  .tbd{color:var(--text-mute);font-style:normal;}
  .schedule-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-mute);margin-top:16px;}

  /* ---------------- AUDIENCE ---------------- */
  .role-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:2px;}
  .role-card{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;transition:background .15s ease;}
  .role-card:hover{background:var(--surface-hover);}
  .role-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-hi);margin-bottom:7px;}
  .role-title .tag{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 7px;margin-right:8px;}
  .role-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.6;}

  /* ---------------- FEATURES ---------------- */
  .feature-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}
  .feature-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);}
  .feature-row:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .feature-num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-mute);}
  .feature-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:9px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  .feature-desc{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.65;max-width:62ch;}
  .feature-note{margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mute);}

  /* ---------------- VIDEO CARD (click to play) ---------------- */
  .video-card{margin-top:20px;background:#000;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;max-width:520px;}
  .video-inner{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;}
  .video-inner img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.7;}
  .video-inner iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border:0;}
  .play-btn{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);width:100%;}
  .play-btn .circle{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);border:1.5px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .play-btn:hover .circle{background:var(--accent);color:#000;}
  .video-caption{padding:9px 4px 0;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mute);}

  /* ---------------- CURRICULUM ---------------- */
  .curriculum{position:relative;padding-left:30px;}
  .curriculum::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:2px;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:1px;background:var(--hairline);}
  .curric-item{position:relative;padding-bottom:32px;}
  .curric-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}
  .curric-item::before{
    content:attr(data-n);position:absolute;left:-30px;top:0;width:16px;
    color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
  }
  .curric-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:7px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:9px;}
  .curric-shift{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 9px;font-weight:500;}
  .curric-desc{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.65;}

  /* ---------------- OBJECTIONS ---------------- */
  .objection{border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);padding:22px 0;}
  .objection:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .objection-q{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-hi);margin-bottom:9px;}
  .objection-q svg{color:var(--text-mute);flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px;}
  .objection-a{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.6;}
  .objection-a svg{color:var(--accent);flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:3px;}

  /* ---------------- COST ---------------- */
  .cost-box{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:18px;}
  .cost-old{font-size:22px;color:var(--text-mute);text-decoration:line-through;}
  .cost-arrow{color:var(--text-mute);}
  .cost-new{font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,64px);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:-.03em;}
  .cost-badge{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft);border-radius:20px;padding:6px 14px;}
  .cost-note{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-lo);line-height:1.7;margin:26px auto 0;max-width:60ch;}
  .cost-note b{color:var(--text-hi);}
  .cost-fine{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mute);margin-top:12px;}

  /* ---------------- APPLY ---------------- */
  .apply-panel{text-align:center;padding:0;}
  .apply-q{font-size:clamp(22px,3.2vw,30px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:32px;}
  .apply-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:14px;}
  .apply-cta{flex:0 1 260px;}
  .apply-cta .btn{width:100%;padding:17px 20px;font-size:15.5px;}
  .apply-cta-label{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mute);margin-bottom:10px;}

  /* ---------------- MOBILE STICKY CTA ---------------- */
  .sticky-cta{
    position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;display:none;
    padding:12px 16px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-top:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);transform:translateY(100%);transition:transform .25s ease;
  }
  .sticky-cta.show{transform:translateY(0);}
  .sticky-cta .btn{width:100%;}
  @media (max-width:720px){ .sticky-cta{display:block;} }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .sticky-cta{transition:none;} }

  /* ---------------- FOOTER ---------------- */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--hairline-soft);padding:44px 0 60px;}
  .footer-links{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:12.5px;}
  .footer-links a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .footer-legal{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-mute);line-height:1.9;}
  .footer-legal a{color:var(--text-mute);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="logo"><span class="mark"></span>메타유닉스<span class="badge">Autodesk Gold Partner</span></div>
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#apply">교육 신청하기</a>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <div class="hero-bg-fallback" id="heroFallback" style="background-image:url('https://img.youtube.com/vi/7DWpnEVCo1A/hqdefault.jpg');"></div>
    <iframe id="heroVideo" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7DWpnEVCo1A?autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&playlist=7DWpnEVCo1A&controls=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1&rel=0" title="배경 영상" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></iframe>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="trust-row">
      <span class="trust-chip"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1l2.1 4.6 5 .5-3.8 3.4 1.1 5-4.4-2.6-4.4 2.6 1.1-5-3.8-3.4 5-.5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Autodesk 공인 Gold Partner</span>
      <span class="trust-chip"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M2 8.5l4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>국비지원 최대 90% 환급</span>
    </div>
    <h1 id="heroTitle">아이디어를 하루 만에,<br><span class="hi">실물로 만드는 법</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" id="heroSub">비전공자도 괜찮습니다. Autodesk Fusion으로 설계부터 CNC 가공까지, 하루 안에 전 과정을 직접 경험하세요.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#apply">교육 신청하기</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#schedule">교육 일정 보기</a>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-strip">
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-label">교육 레벨</div><div class="fact-value">초급 · 비전공자 가능</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-label">교육 시간</div><div class="fact-value">오전 10시 ~ 오후 5시 (점심 1시간 포함)</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-label">교육비</div><div class="fact-value">실부담 10만원 (국비 90% 환급)</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel" id="schedule">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">교육 일정</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">전국 5개 지역에서 진행됩니다</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">가까운 지역과 일정을 확인하고 신청하세요. 정부 예산 소진 시 접수가 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.</p>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>지역</th><th>교육 장소</th><th>일자</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="city">서울</td><td>오토데스크 코리아 @삼성동 아셈타워</td><td class="date">9/16 (수)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="city">부산</td><td class="tbd">장소 추후 안내</td><td class="date">9/23 (수)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="city">대구</td><td class="tbd">장소 추후 안내</td><td class="date">10/13 (수)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="city">서울</td><td>스팩스페이스 @마곡동</td><td class="date">10/20 (화)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="city">천안</td><td class="tbd">장소 추후 안내</td><td class="date">11/4 (화)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="schedule-note">20명 이상 단체 신청 시 원하는 지역으로 출강도 가능합니다.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel" id="audience">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">교육 대상</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">이런 역할을 하고 있다면 추천합니다</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">Autodesk Fusion 및 CNC 장비 사용 경험이 없어도 참여할 수 있습니다.</p>
    <div class="role-grid">
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">설계</span>CAD 설계자를 꿈꾼다면</div><div class="role-desc">제품 아이디어를 직접 3D로 설계해보고 싶은 재직자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">입문</span>Fusion이 처음이라면</div><div class="role-desc">Autodesk Fusion을 처음 배우는 비전공자 및 입문자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">가공</span>CAM 프로그래머가 궁금하다면</div><div class="role-desc">3D CAD와 CAM의 전체 작업 흐름을 경험하고 싶은 재직자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">현업</span>제조·생산기술 엔지니어라면</div><div class="role-desc">제품개발, 연구개발, 생산기술, 설비관리 및 품질관리 분야 재직자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">확장</span>2D에서 3D로 넘어가고 싶다면</div><div class="role-desc">기존 2D 설계 업무를 3D 설계로 확장하고 싶은 실무자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">제작</span>시제품 제작 엔지니어라면</div><div class="role-desc">간단한 부품, 지그, 고정구 및 시제품 제작에 관심 있는 재직자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">운용</span>CNC 오퍼레이터가 궁금하다면</div><div class="role-desc">CNC 가공과 디지털 제조 프로세스를 이해하고 싶은 재직자</div></div>
      <div class="role-card"><div class="role-title"><span class="tag">실현</span>아이디어를 제품으로 연결하고 싶다면</div><div class="role-desc">자신의 아이디어를 실제 제품 제작 과정으로 연결하고 싶은 재직자</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel" id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">교육 특징</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">지금껏 볼 수 없었던 구성</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">단순한 소프트웨어 기능 교육이 아니라, 설계부터 실제 가공까지 이어지는 하루짜리 실습입니다.</p>
    <div class="feature-list">
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-num">01</div>
